{"ID":"20240205153732-up44w8y","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153732-up44w8y","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153732-up44w8y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206140448-5tzs0f8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619195944-u78ok12\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"柿蒂","type":"doc","updated":"20240902091333"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206140448-5tzs0f8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206140448-5tzs0f8","updated":"20240206140457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产河南、山东，福建、河北、山西等地。\n【性状】\t呈扁圆形，直径1.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.5cm。中央较厚，微隆起，有果实脱落后的圆形疤痕，边缘较薄，4裂，裂片多反卷，易碎；基部有果梗或圆孔状的果梗痕。外表面黄褐色或红棕色，内表面黄棕色，密被细绒毛。质硬而脆。无臭，味涩。\n【性味】\t苦、涩，平。\n【功效】\t降逆下气。用于呃逆。"}]},{"ID":"20240206140447-zfu334s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206140447-zfu334s","updated":"20240206140447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206140447-0f7tqt4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205162146-abap5pe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205162146-abap5pe","updated":"20240205162146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"柿蒂"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/柿蒂-20240205162146-bi5jjsx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715110337-dwkaasf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715110337-dwkaasf","updat